meta.githubCommitMessage:
fix(seo): remove dead @motivahub Twitter handle (404)

@twitter.com/motivahub returns 404 — handle never existed or was deleted. Same on x.com. Three places removed: AuthorBio social links, Layout Organization sameAs schema, Layout footer social block, author page sameAs schema. Only the article share-intent link (SocialShare.astro) is kept — it works regardless of whether the user has a Twitter account.

Removes 4 broken backlinks, strengthens schema accuracy, and avoids Google's 'broken social link' trust signal.
